  "content": "<h2><strong>动物喂食槽</strong></h2>\n<p>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a>。</p>\n<p><em>对于 MC &lt;1.19 的版本，需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></em></p>\n<h3><strong>描述</strong></h3>\n<p>可以被引诱的生物会寻找装有它们最爱食物的喂食槽。鸡会寻找装有种子的喂食槽，猪会寻找装有胡萝卜的喂食槽，以此类推。生物的行为就像是被玩家喂食了一样，进入恋爱状态并最终繁殖。</p>\n<h3><strong>合成配方</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/w6lexyA.png\" alt=\"Recipe\" width=\"243\" height=\"136\"></p>\n<h3><strong>下载</strong></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animal-feeding-trough\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fanimal_feeding_trough\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> | <a href=\"https://github.com/Slexom/animal-feeding-trough/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></p>\n<h3><strong>相关模组</strong></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-feeding-trough-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>更多喂食槽变体</strong></a> by <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">pnku</a></p>",
